35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, but the heavy use weeks reveal the real friction. We need a system that accounts for those bursts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the other households confirm it: asking favours sours the bond. Our weekly trips are the real trouble. We need to protect those slots.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the mechanic confirmed short cold runs destroy the brakes and battery. Your diary data must show if we are doing this constantly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the receipts show two of us bought over half the fuel. The diary proves Saturdays are triple Tuesdays. The imbalance is undeniable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the trial took an hour a week just to check figures. That’s the real cost. I need to know if we can stop the accusations.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, that imbalance is exactly what I suspected. The fixed costs are shared, but the fuel burden is not. We need a formula that reflects actual usage, not just equal shares.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, the other households found that asking favours is the poison. If we lock in the weekly trips, we stop asking. That saves the relationship, not just the time.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
