44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, I agree. If we stop asking favours, we stop the accusations. I just need a system that doesn’t take an hour a week to manage.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the mechanic’s warning is critical. If the car degrades, the 280,000 yen fixed cost becomes a liability. We need a maintenance protocol, not just a schedule.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
